1. Install the Required Software: On the new computer.

Download and install XAMPP.
Download and install Tesseract OCR.
Crucial: Make sure Tesseract installs to C:\Program Files\Tesseract-OCR on the new computer, otherwise you will have to update the path in your apply.
php and edit_application.php files! 

2. Paste the Project Files at C:\xampp\htdocs\

3.Export the Database:From your current computer.

Open your browser and go to http://localhost/phpmyadmin.
Click on your scholarship_db database on the left sidebar.
Click the Export tab at the top of the screen.
Leave the settings on "Quick" and format as "SQL", then click Export (or "Go").
This will download a file named scholarship_db.sql. Save this file to a USB drive or email it to yourself.

4.Import the Database:On the new computer.

Open a browser on the new PC and go to http://localhost/phpmyadmin.
Click New on the left sidebar.
Name the database exactly as before: scholarship_db and click Create.
Click on the new scholarship_db database, then click the Import tab at the top.
Click Choose File, select the scholarship_db.sql file from your USB drive, scroll down, and click Import.



